<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>Phoenix Core | FHI Empire Command</title><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}:root{--g:#D4AF37;--e:#00ff88;--d:#ff4444;--w:#ffaa00}body{background:#050505;color:#e0e0e0;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;min-height:100vh}.tb{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#000,#111,#000);border-bottom:2px solid var(--g);padding:.6rem 1.5rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1000}.tb h1{font-size:1rem;color:var(--g);letter-spacing:2px}.tb .live{color:var(--e);font-size:.7rem}.nt{display:flex;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;background:#080808}.nt button{flex:1;padding:.7rem;background:transparent;border:none;color:#888;font-size:.7rem;cursor:pointer;border-bottom:2px solid transparent}.nt button:hover{color:#fff}.nt button.on{color:var(--g);border-bottom-color:var(--g);background:rgba(212,175,55,.05)}.cn{padding:1rem;max-width:1600px;margin:0 auto;display:none}.cn.on{display:block}.gr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:1rem}.pn{background:#0a0a0a;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;border-radius:8px;padding:1rem;position:relative}.pn::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:var(--g);opacity:.4}.pn.c::before{background:var(--d);opacity:.8}.pn h2{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--g);letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.8rem}.cd{padding:.7rem;border:1px solid #222;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:.5rem;background:#0d0d0d}.cd.c{border-color:var(--d);background:rgba(255,68,68,.04)}.cd h3{font-size:.8rem;color:#fff;margin-bottom:.2rem}.cd p{font-size:.7rem;color:#888;line-height:1.5}.cd .id{font-family:monospace;font-size:.65rem;color:var(--g)}.cd .v{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--e)}.cd .v.d{color:var(--d)}.bt{font-size:.65rem;padding:.25rem .5rem;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #444;color:#aaa;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;margin-right:.3rem}.bt:hover{border-color:var(--g);color:var(--g)}.bt.dg{border-color:var(--d);color:var(--d)}.bt.eg{border-color:var(--e);color:var(--e)}.mc{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:.4rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;font-size:.75rem}.mc .l{color:#888}.mc .v{color:#fff}.mc .v.p{color:var(--e)}.mc .v.n{color:var(--d)}.tt{text-align:center;padding:1rem;border:1px dashed var(--g);border-radius:6px;margin-top:1rem}.tt .n{font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--g);font-weight:700}.ft{text-align:center;padding:1rem;color:#444;font-size:.65rem;border-top:1px solid #1a1a1a;margin-top:1rem}</style></head><body><div class="tb"><h1>☥ PHOENIX CORE — FHI EMPIRE</h1><div class="live">● SYSTEM OPERATIONAL</div></div><div class="nt"><button class="on" onclick="st(this,"ov")">📊 Overview</button><button onclick="st(this,"li")">⚖️ Litigation</button><button onclick="st(this,"re")">💰 Revenue</button><button onclick="st(this,"ag")">🤖 Agents</button><button onclick="st(this,"se")">🛡️ Security</button></div><div class="cn on" id="ov"><div class="gr"><div class="pn c"><h2>🔴 Critical Alerts</h2><div class="cd c"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span class="id">CIBC #12057596</span><span class="v d">5 DAYS LEFT</span></div><h3>$2.5M Demand — Deadline Aug 31, 11:59 PM</h3><p>Supervisor Rami escalated to head office. File police + OBSI + FCAC tonight.</p><a class="bt dg" href="tel:1-800-465-2422">Call CIBC</a><a class="bt" href="https://www.obsi.ca" target="_blank">File OBSI</a></div><div class="cd c"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span class="id">PAYPAL BUG</span><span class="v d">BLOCKING REVENUE</span></div><h3>paypal.me/techpetcage charges DEREK not customers</h3><p>Every payment button wired backwards. Total revenue = $0 until fixed.</p><a class="bt dg" href="https://www.paypal.com/business" target="_blank">Fix PayPal</a></div></div><div class="pn"><h2>📊 Empire Snapshot</h2><div class="mc"><span class="l">Total Claims</span><span class="v">$40,831,313.21</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Active Cases</span><span class="v">3</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Companies</span><span class="v">45+</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Tower Floors</span><span class="v">460</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">AI Agents</span><span class="v p">12,847</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Monthly Revenue</span><span class="v n">$0</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Security Threat</span><span class="v p">MINIMAL</span></div></div><div class="pn"><h2>⛓️ Chain of Command</h2><div class="mc"><span class="l">👑 Derek Francisco</span><span class="v p">Emperor — ONLINE</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">🧠 Kimi K3</span><span class="v p">Oversight — MONITORING</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">🔧 Claude</span><span class="v p">Build — ACTIVE</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">⚖️ PrimeDox Legal</span><span class="v p">3 Cases Tracked</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">🛡️ OmniAGuard</span><span class="v p">0 Threats</span></div></div></div></div><div class="cn" id="li"><div class="gr"><div class="pn c" style="grid-column:1/-1"><h2>⚖️ Active Litigation</h2><div class="cd c"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span class="id">CIBC/KUDOS/TELUS #12057596</span><span class="v d">$2,500,000</span></div><h3>Fraud, Theft, Negligence, Disability Discrimination</h3><p>Supervisor: Rami | Named: Andrew Slopianka #5420, Assim (AK...) | Opened: Aug 25, 2026 6:15 PM<br>12 issues documented. Key evidence: Rami admitted "no mechanism to protect your money".<br>Theories: Crim. Code s.380(1), s.362(1), negligence, fiduciary breach, HRT, OBSI, FCAC.</p><a class="bt dg" href="tel:1-800-465-2422">Call CIBC</a><a class="bt" href="https://www.obsi.ca" target="_blank">File OBSI</a><a class="bt" href="https://www.canada.ca/en/financial-consumer-agency" target="_blank">File FCAC</a></div><div class="cd"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span class="id">CV-26-00000064-0000</span><span class="v">$3,300,000</span></div><h3>Francisco v. Denby et al. — Kawartha Lakes</h3><p>Gwen Denby IN DEFAULT (served Apr 24). 2413319 Ontario Inc. added. Hearing July 14 PASSED. Check court portal daily for judgment. PIN: 63163-0286.</p><a class="bt" href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/ontario-court-justice" target="_blank">Court Portal</a><a class="bt dg" href="#" onclick="alert(Draft Default Judgment: Form 27A + Affidavit)">Default Judgment</a></div><div class="cd"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span class="id">CV-26-00000063-0000</span><span class="v">$35,000,000</span></div><h3>Constitutional Claim — Francisco v. AG Canada & Health Canada</h3><p>Charter s.7 + s.15 | ODSP cannabis exclusion. Gov spends $244M/year on veterans cannabis. Arbitrary exclusion for disabled. Draft SoC, serve Crown Law Office.</p><a class="bt" href="#" onclick="alert(Draft SoC: Charter s.7 + s.15)">Draft SoC</a><a class="bt" href="https://www.ontario.ca/page/crown-law-office-civil" target="_blank">Crown Law</a></div><div class="tt"><div style="font-size:.65rem;color:#888">TOTAL CLAIM VALUE</div><div class="n">$40,831,313.21</div></div></div></div></div><div class="cn" id="re"><div class="gr"><div class="pn c" style="grid-column:1/-1"><h2>💰 Revenue Blocker</h2><div class="cd c"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between"><span class="id">PAYPAL BUG</span><span class="v d">$0 REVENUE</span></div><h3>paypal.me/techpetcage charges DEREK instead of customers</h3><p>Fix: Create BUSINESS PayPal → Get Client ID → Replace ALL links → Verify customer charging. Temp: All buttons show "Coming Soon".</p><a class="bt dg" href="https://www.paypal.com/business" target="_blank">Create Business PayPal</a></div></div><div class="pn"><h2>📉 Revenue by Company</h2><div class="mc"><span class="l">PrimeDox AI HQ</span><span class="v n">$0/mo</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">OmniAGuard</span><span class="v n">$0/mo</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Vault Velocity Auto</span><span class="v n">$0/mo</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">CCLDR / Weedlaw</span><span class="v n">$0/mo</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">CleanSwarm</span><span class="v n">$0/mo</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">TechPetCage</span><span class="v n">$0/mo</span></div><div class="tt"><div style="font-size:.65rem;color:#888">TOTAL MONTHLY</div><div class="n" style="color:var(--d)">$0</div></div></div><div class="pn" style="border-color:var(--e)"><h2 style="color:var(--e)">📈 Revenue Targets (Post-Fix)</h2><div class="mc"><span class="l">PrimeDox AI HQ</span><span class="v p">$15,000/mo</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">OmniAGuard</span><span class="v p">$12,000/mo</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Vault Velocity Auto</span><span class="v p">$10,000/mo</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">CCLDR / Weedlaw</span><span class="v p">$8,000/mo</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">CleanSwarm</span><span class="v p">$3,000/mo</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">TechPetCage</span><span class="v p">$2,000/mo</span></div><div class="tt" style="border-color:var(--e)"><div style="font-size:.65rem;color:#888">TARGET MONTHLY</div><div class="n" style="color:var(--e)">$50,000/mo</div></div></div></div></div><div class="cn" id="ag"><div class="gr"><div class="pn"><h2>🤖 Agent Swarm Status</h2><div class="mc"><span class="l">⚖️ PrimeDox Legal</span><span class="v p">● ACTIVE — 3 Cases</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">🛡️ OmniAGuard Sentinel</span><span class="v p">● ACTIVE — 0 Threats</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">📊 Revenue Optimizer</span><span class="v" style="color:var(--w)">● BLOCKED — PayPal</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">🌿 Doc Weedlaw</span><span class="v p">● ACTIVE — CV-63</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">🏎️ Vault Velocity</span><span class="v p">● ACTIVE — Floor 10</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">🧹 CleanSwarm</span><span class="v p">● ACTIVE — Floor 50</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">🎙️ Voice PrimeDox</span><span class="v p">● ACTIVE — Ready</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">👤 Avatar Command</span><span class="v p">● ACTIVE — Deployed</span></div><div style="margin-top:.8rem;padding:.5rem;border:1px dashed #555;border-radius:6px;text-align:center;font-size:.65rem;color:#888">Total: <strong style="color:#fff">12,847</strong> | Learning: <strong style="color:var(--e)">ALL OS MODELS</strong> | Watchers: <strong style="color:#44aaff">Claude + Kimi K3</strong></div></div><div class="pn"><h2 style="color:#44aaff">🔵 Swarm Intelligence</h2><div class="mc"><span class="l">LLaMA 3.1</span><span class="v p">● SYNCED</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Mistral Large</span><span class="v p">● SYNCED</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Gemma 31B</span><span class="v p">● SYNCED</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Qwen 2.5</span><span class="v p">● SYNCED</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">DeepSeek V2</span><span class="v p">● SYNCED</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Phi-3</span><span class="v p">● SYNCED</span></div><div style="margin-top:.5rem;font-size:.65rem;color:#888">Cross-train on all OS models. Kimi K3 validates high-stakes. Human-in-the-loop for: litigation, finances, new company reg.</div></div></div></div><div class="cn" id="se"><div class="gr"><div class="pn" style="border-color:var(--e)"><h2 style="color:var(--e)">🛡️ Threat Status</h2><div style="text-align:center;padding:1rem"><div style="font-size:3rem;color:var(--e)">🛡️</div><div style="font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--e);font-weight:700;margin-top:.3rem">SECURE</div><div style="font-size:.7rem;color:#888">No active threats</div></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Network</span><span class="v p">LOW</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">DDoS</span><span class="v p">LOW</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Injection</span><span class="v p">LOW</span></div><div class="mc"><span class="l">Credential</span><span class="v p">LOW</span></div></div><div class="pn"><h2>🔒 Prompt Injection Defense</h2><div class="cd"><h3>🧠 Kimi K3 — Human-in-the-Loop</h3><p>Monitors ALL outputs for injection, jailbreak, hallucinations. Flags suspicious output for Derek review before execution.</p></div><div class="cd"><h3>🔧 Claude — Build Integrity</h3><p>Validates all code before deployment. No file goes live without dual verification. Git history preserved for rollback.</p></div><div class="cd"><h3>📡 Agent Swarm — Consensus</h3><p>12,847 agents run cross-validation. Outlier outputs quarantined. Prevents single-point-of-failure attacks.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="ft">Phoenix Core v3.0 | Francisco Holdings Inc. | Phoenix Dominion | ALL PINs: Cisco1170$ | GitHub: franciscoderek7<br>Chain: Agents → PrimeDox → Claude → Kimi K3 → Derek | Not a Lawyer — Legal Educator Only</div><script>function st(btn,id){document.querySelectorAll(".cn").forEach(c=>c.classList.remove("on"));document.querySelectorAll(".nt button").forEach(b=>b.classList.remove("on"));document.getElementById(id).classList.add("on");btn.classList.add("on")}</script></body></html>
